                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]Chinese drama roguelike detective VN where you're courting death[/h1]\n\nAhead of its time n rather unique in the VN genre seeing how rare roguelike VNs are.\nProbably the only other neat roguelike VN I know of aside from this one is Slay the Princess.\n\nAnd just like Slay the Princess, Soulslayer is one of the VNs I'd recommend to even those who are not into VNs because, Soulslayer is full of intrigue, interesting characters as well as a relatable MC n most importantly, lots of drama n juicy gossip. \n\nIt has got to be something with the VNs having Slay in their name that they end up being so slay, yea?\n\nThis one is very repeatable with lots of endings and routes. \nMinor spoilers: You're probably going to die more than you do in Elden Ring in this one at least by Visual Novel standards but dying is part of the fun n the experience n also part of what makes this a unique gem in the rough.\n\nThe art is distinct n spectacular. It brings the characters to life alongside the sweet Chinese va.\n\nStrong recommend from me specially if you like ancient Chinese media n drama. \n\nMy only wish is if it was longer like Slay the Princess but its quite enjoyable as is with a fair share of hilarious situations here n there as well so that's an easy 10/10 rom me.",
